  "worked_solution": "From the graph, we see ${lim}_{x\\to \\,2}f(x)=4.$\n\nWe factor the constant out of the limit and evaluate the remaining limit, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 2}Cf(x) & =\\frac{4}{3} \\\\ C\\cdot {lim}_{x\\to 2}f(x) & =\\frac{4}{3} \\\\ C\\cdot 4 & =\\frac{4}{3} \\\\ C & =\\frac{1}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
